ai_agent='claude|anthropic|chatgpt|openai|copilot|codex|gemini|cursoragent|generated with|🤖'

matches=$(sed '/^# -* >8 -*$/,$d' "$1" | grep -v '^#' | grep -inE "$ai_agent" || true)

if [ -n "$matches" ]; then
  cat >&2 <<EOF

warning: this commit message mentions an AI agent:

$matches

While AI-assisted coding is allowed in this project, we expect all
contributors to take ownership of their work. For that reason, we do not
accept any commit with a co-author of an AI agent, or any commit message
with mention of an AI agent. Before submitting or opening a PR, please
review your code and commits and remove such attribution accordingly.

EOF
fi
